            "text": "<p>At the heart of BlissThera<strong>® & Mindscape Forest theraceuticals </strong>is the science of <em><strong>phytochemical synergy</strong></em>, where plant-derived compounds—terpenes, flavonoids, and other bioactive plant molecules—are delivered in carefully controlled combinations to enhance and support the body’s ability to regulate its homeostatic mechanisms. This therapeutic synergy occurs when multiple phytochemicals interact with various receptor systems in the body, amplifying their collective therapeutic effects.<br/><br/>At home therapies can be administered through BlissThera® Elixirs and the Forest Flute Personal Atmosphere Technology.</p>",
